Third-party code
================

SmartportCFA / SmartportSD
--------------------------

The SmartPort bus routines in src/packet_16mhz.S and the bus handshake and
reset sequence in loop() of src/main.cpp come from SmartportCFA/SmartportSD
by Robert Justice and Andrea Ottaviani, as continued by Katherine Stark
(FAT version also by Eric Helgeson). They were changed for Core4SD (see the
head of src/packet_16mhz.S).

Hardware documentation (hardware/)
----------------------------------

The schematics, breadboard layouts and their description in hardware/ were
drawn for Core4SD and are under the GNU GPL version 3 or later like the rest
of Core4SD. They show the SmartPort wiring of the SmartportCFA/SmartportSD
design by Robert Justice (Arduino port by Andrea Ottaviani). Boards A and B
follow the SPIISD V1 by Kay Koba (Kero's Mac Mods,
github.com/kerokero5150/SP2SD_DIY_KIT).

The SPIISD hardware itself (circuit board layout, Gerber files) is not part
of Core4SD. Kay Koba publishes it under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

SmartportSD is published under the MIT License, as stated by the SP2SD DIY
kit (github.com/kerokero5150/SP2SD_DIY_KIT, SMARTPORTSD_LICENSE.md):

Copyright (c) 2020-2023 Katherine Stark, Robert Justice, Andrea Ottaviani

