SOFTWARE.


Libraries in the firmware (bin/core4sd_328p.hex, bin/core4sd_328pb.hex)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The built firmware also contains these libraries. They are not part of this
source tree; PlatformIO fetches them when building.

- SdFat 2.3 by Bill Greiman (github.com/greiman/SdFat), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2011-2024 Bill Greiman.
- The Arduino AVR core (MiniCore, github.com/MCUdude/MiniCore), GNU Lesser
  General Public License 2.1. The complete source of Core4SD is in this
  repository, so the firmware can be rebuilt and relinked with a changed core.
